  mismatch_A: "13, 15, 16, 17 are marked prompt_not_submitted yet Codex received them; e.g. 13 reached Codex at 00:09:19 (rollout + logs_2.sqlite op.dispatch.turn_input) and its failure line appears at 00:09:41 when the turn ended."
