code_path: "Windows ConPTY transport: ChannelPromptInjector writes ^U + bracketed body, waits for the prompt render (prefix or '[Pasted Content' marker), then Enter up to N times; acceptance is decided only by TranscriptSubmissionReceipt (new user record in the latest Codex rollout containing the whole prompt). If the render wait times out it sends ^U and returns False without Enter; if every receipt check is False it returns False after the Enters."
not_determined:
